  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Env-Wt 900 STREAM CROSSINGS; CERTIFIED CULVERT MAINTAINER PROGRAM\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 482-A:11\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #12809, effective 12-15-19, adopted or readopted with amendment all of the rules in Chapter Env-Wt 900 and changed the chapter heading from “Stream Crossings” to “Stream Crossings; Certified Culvert Maintainer Program.”\n\nDocument #12809 replaces all prior filings for rules in the former Env-Wt 900.\n\nThe prior filings for former Chapter Env-Wt 900 included the following documents:\n\n#9714, eff 5-12-10\n\n#10491, eff 12-21-13\n\n#12578, eff 7-21-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt900.html"
